"""
RF Prediction Pipeline

This script implements the full pipeline for GPR data analysis and fouling prediction.
It performs the following steps:
1. Loads ground truth data (Pandoscope) and GPR data.
2. Defines the feature set used for the model.
3. Loads a pre-trained XGBoost/Random Forest model.
4. Runs predictions on the GPR data.
5. Applies regularization to the predictions.
6. Visualizes the results, creating comparative plots between model predictions and ground truth.

Usage:
    Run this script directly to execute the pipeline. Ensure paths to datasets and models are correct.
"""

